{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>עששה</b> [is] from the root of עש יאכלם [\"a moth will consume them\"]." "<b>And the meaning of עיני</b> — because he sees in his illness his enemies rejoicing, and this is the meaning of מכעס [\"with anger\"], and these his enemies visit him to see their vengeance; therefore after it [comes] סורו ממני [\"turn away from me\"]." "<b>And the word עתקה</b> — it has turned to my eye from much weeping." "<b>And the meaning of בכל צררי</b> — on account of all my foes, and many like it."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:30.817681780Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}